# 19. Basic Security Practices

For your report, remember these:

### 🔐 Account security

* Use unique passwords
* Use MFA
* Don't share passwords
* Don't share authentication codes

### 📧 Email security

* Verify unexpected messages
* Check sender information
* Don't blindly click links
* Be careful with attachments

### 💻 Device security

* Keep operating systems updated
* Update applications
* Use reputable security tools
* Lock your device

### 🌐 Internet security

* Use trusted websites
* Check website addresses
* Avoid entering sensitive information on suspicious pages
* Be cautious on public networks

### 💾 Data security

* Back up important information
* Don't share confidential information unnecessarily
* Use appropriate access controls

